Juniper: Clair-voyant, and that’s not how it works.
Barb: Ugh, I swear when it doesn’t involve some sort of Mummy’s curse you two have the memory of a goldfish.
Lizzy: Listen, I’d care a lot more about dress shopping if I wasn’t kicking demon ass on a regular basis.
Barb: The grad dance is the single most important nights of our entire lives!
