Noah: There are subtleties.
Juniper: If you’re really that pressed about it, Barb, I’m sure Lizzy and I can throw something together.
Barb: I don’t want you to throw something together! I want you both to look pretty and for me to look even prettier!
Noah: I wouldn’t worry about grad, if you know what I mean...
